### 示例 1: 使用插件进行前置认证与报文加签 (Pipeline Stage Demo)
# Prepare 阶段 (@auth 注解即 Prepare): 生成动态 Authorization Token
# Sign 阶段 (@sign 注解即 Sign): 根据完整报文计算 X-Echo-Signature
# 即使书写顺序对调，内核亦依据不可逆阶段单向流 (Prepare -> Transform -> Sign) 与同阶段书写行序严格保序（priority 魔数已废除）
POST https://httpbin.org/post
@auth echo-sign key=my-secret-key ?optional
@sign echo-sign prefix=V2

Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": 9527,
  "action": "create_payment"
}

@assert status == 200
@assert headers["Content-Type"] contains "application/json"

### 示例 2: 声明式自愈降级示例 (Fallback Gracefully)
# 生产调试机无 Python 插件时，?optional 自动跳过外部插件调用并记录黄色警告
# 配合静态兜底 Header，发包与底层网络时序 (DNS/TCP/TLS/TTFB) 100% 录入快照黑匣子
GET https://httpbin.org/get
@auth not-installed-plugin key=production-secret ?optional
Authorization: Bearer {{DEBUG_FALLBACK_TOKEN}}
